{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4001_030iku", "source_sha256": "d47d4f8367e00421bb18d9f6f55763c25c276833c71978b440afdeec560908da", "ja": "う～ん……。卵……。卵のお料理……。", "zh": "唔……鸡蛋……鸡蛋料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4002_p", "source_sha256": "8fc0cf1063499e31a25402aff0606d05bd899caa513642db98011332002e2ebc", "ja": "どうした、育。お腹が空いてるのか？", "zh": "怎么了，育？肚子饿了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4003_030iku", "source_sha256": "add05652418be9601c58e28d8e41daae08ac936d6b4c1455c7bccc92443fd7a3", "ja": "もう、ちがうよっ！　\nあのね、わたし、今度お料理番組に出るでしょう？", "zh": "真是的，不是啦！\n就是啊，我这次要上烹饪节目对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4004_030iku", "source_sha256": "a49b8ddbd2fa3d0fed6bf4fefc88fdb9b35dad2dd0cb1da4941fb400579f1bef", "ja": "そこで、卵をつかったお料理をひとつ作らないと\nいけないんだけど……。何を作ろうか、迷ってるんだ。", "zh": "上节目的时候，得用鸡蛋做一道菜才行……\n我在犹豫要做什么才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4005_030iku", "source_sha256": "b99d5aea865b50a24098bc3727c6020b91677dbc2e7651b09d9863c9ae64ea11", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}さんは\nなにを作ったらいいと思う？", "zh": "问你喔，{$P$}先生，\n你觉得要做什么好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4006_p", "source_sha256": "a74d4b65bc357a29456828f241e6dd7621c988a4402000c6ba9b168cc559467f", "ja": "そうだなぁ、ここは……。", "zh": "这个嘛，今天就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4007", "source_sha256": "1fcf0b3c12838c7dbc29f124730dcded01154702247502a055dd313b2270d655", "ja": "目玉焼き", "zh": "荷包蛋", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
