{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4009", "source_sha256": "3e23cb7ee3dac059c9cb19b992229f6291d916ad2396f2cdc4744ef6dd4d0384", "ja": "オムライス", "zh": "蛋包饭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4100_p", "source_sha256": "f83402871f5af6ced88255ab2f54d0418825e64d1cdc8ad14e0a7ce141fb4e61", "ja": "目玉焼きがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "做荷包蛋感觉还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4101_030iku", "source_sha256": "39e98b3a7b431453bf7061b33068f8e54f76bb6386cebe70541185f2b0b2f821", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、そう思うっ？\nえへへ……わたし、きれいな目玉焼き作れるんだよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也这么想？？\n嘿嘿……我会做很漂亮的荷包蛋喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4102_030iku", "source_sha256": "c2a981772a2b27aa4db2b901ef1a38de13b9ff3f9297773bc3e510e4fd54cd65", "ja": "明日作ってくるから、{$P$}さん、\n食べてくれる？　約束っ♪", "zh": "我明天会做好带来的，{$P$}先生\n你能帮我试吃看看吗？一言为定喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4200_p", "source_sha256": "3c4b8a5993398d75e90c4e756ab3641705eb5aae956743be769eaa72690edd6f", "ja": "ゆでたまご、がいいんじゃないか。\nシンプルで。", "zh": "做水煮蛋感觉还不错吧？\n很单纯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4201_030iku", "source_sha256": "fce8aad710973acf5f380b6fd5052fe85b4330a9e96d60d934ea9b637c688b11", "ja": "え～？　それじゃあ、かんたんすぎないかなぁ？", "zh": "咦～？那会不会太简单了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4202_030iku", "source_sha256": "32adc4f7770d87b7adac7c2500532a3068a0314c6c80c82371212ba3066aacb5", "ja": "でも、そうだねっ。ゆでたまごなら、絶対、\n失敗したりしないし……。それにしようっと！", "zh": "不过，说得也是呢。如果做水煮蛋，\n就绝对不会失败了……就选这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4300_p", "source_sha256": "7f3bc361263a1239e37e3a56d91e2d7c705fdfbac50dfac3297aa7692cfcd79d", "ja": "オムライスがいいんじゃないか。\nよく、おうちで作るって言ってなかったか？", "zh": "做蛋包饭感觉还不错吧？\n你不是说常常会在家做蛋包饭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4301_030iku", "source_sha256": "01e7940852db009caa1611de29ac859d7feb451fb760fe561366014ecd7b8b42", "ja": "えっ！？　えっと……、そうだけど……。\nい、いつもは、お母さんと……。", "zh": "咦！？呃……是没错啦……\n平、平常是和妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4302_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_4303_030iku", "source_sha256": "8d98d6fbb1484a90c07a89ca4d0540eff8c748820aba60fe550d7fb475904995", "ja": "う、ううん！　なんでもない！　……わたし、\nいっぱい練習するね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "不、不！没事！……我\n会多多练习的，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
